WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Don't secretly take advantage of trivial matters

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,240
It’s been a long time

3
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,160
No matter how good the relationship is, it can't withstand the barrier

4
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,480
Bow your head when you should bow your head

5
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,080
Float softly when it’s time to float softly

6
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:10,040
Don’t always wait for the other person to speak first

7
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,760
Tell your mother the truth

8
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:14,080
Is the problem on your side or on her side?

9
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:18,300
Of course it’s her, Ayu

10
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,540
Your grandmother's side

11
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,820
I'm ranked second

12
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,700
There is a sister above me who is more sensible than me

13
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,700
There is a younger sister down there who is better at coquettishness than me.

14
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,900
Being in the middle is the least popular

15
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,700
I have been unable to grasp anything since I was a child.

16
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,700
At that time, I just had an idea

17
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:33,860
When you marry in the future, you don’t want to be rich and powerful.

18
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:36,770
I just want to marry someone I can handle

19
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:38,770
So pick and choose

20
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:40,010
Picked your dad

21
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,450
Your father has a soft temper

22
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,490
This is a good thing and a bad thing

23
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:45,010
Sometimes I also think

24
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:46,650
If he has an idea

25
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:48,810
Do I need to worry less?

26
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:50,250
But the prince is different too
